\title{tidyGenR: Tidy multilocus amplicon genotypes in R}
\description{
package used to determine variants and genotypes from high throughput sequences from multilocus amplicon libraries, typically sequenced in Illumina MiSeq or similar. It provides a set of core functions for the central steps: demultiplex by locus, truncate reads, variant call, and genotype call. Additionally, it provides a set of functions for diagnosis and estimation of best running parameters and multiple extensions for genotype/variants manipulation and reformatting. Output variants and genotypes are output in 'tidy' format, thus facilitating reformatting, manipulation and potential connection to other R packages.
